### [coveres](/coveres) [May 19, 2025](#discussioncomment-13196354)

| I've tracked down the cause, it's the modifications in `src/apprt/gtk/Surface.zig` commit [ffdf86374a964dba28ca2998e914c0eece13a394](https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty/commit/ffdf86374a964dba28ca2998e914c0eece13a394). Adding the code back (replacing `.invalid` with `.unidentified`) fixes the issue. |
